      "question": "Can I put more than $7000 in a Roth IRA?",
      "type": "featured_snippet",
      "snippet": "The Roth IRA contribution limit for 2024 is $7,000 for those under 50, and $8,000 for those 50 and older. In 2025, the Roth IRA contribution limit is the same as for 2024 at $7,000 for those under 50, and $8,000 for those 50 and older.",
